  "security_implications": "Key material (secret_key) is wiped under wipe_secret condition; failure to properly clear could leave sensitive key data in registers. Outputs (intr_hmac_done_o, intr_fifo_empty_o, tl_o.d_valid, tl_o.a_ready, alert_tx_o) are checked for known values to prevent X-propagation, which could leak internal state or secrets. Register write one-hot check triggers an alert if violated; missing or incorrect alert could allow unauthorized register accesses, impacting security. The assumption on hmac_en transition ensures safe mode changes, preventing potential misuse that might expose or corrupt ongoing cryptographic operations.",
